# Build-context hygiene. The sandbox image (images/Dockerfile) only copies specific
# packages/pi-host and packages/piwork-* sources and installs its deps INSIDE the image,
# so none of the below is needed — and shipping it (mostly node_modules) sent ~650 MB to
# the Docker daemon on every build. Keep this in sync if the Dockerfile's COPY paths grow.

# Dependencies (the image runs its own npm install)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output / caches
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS, editor, OS cruft
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# Not copied by the Dockerfile
packages/shell
packages/bridge-protocol
examples/
design/
docs/
.claude/
.github/

# Ephemeral spike/smoke/delivery/probe workspaces
.spike-tmp-*/
.smoke-tmp-*/
.deliv-tmp-*/
.probe*/
